[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 18541.35, "timestamp": "05:09:01", "text": "够难的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18543.99, "timestamp": "05:09:03", "text": "不要原谅你……呃，原谅你的兄弟。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18546.31, "timestamp": "05:09:06", "text": "他们利用了你。没错。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18548.494, "timestamp": "05:09:08", "text": "他们做到了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18549.802, "timestamp": "05:09:09", "text": "[嗤笑]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18555.11, "timestamp": "05:09:15", "text": "是的，我正想说这个。为什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18557.43, "timestamp": "05:09:17", "text": "我无法将其视为法律案件，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18558.948, "timestamp": "05:09:18", "text": "东西？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18561.27, "timestamp": "05:09:21", "text": "我的意思是，我仍然可以做到。我仍然"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18563.11, "timestamp": "05:09:23", "text": "我得跟我的律师谈谈。他们只是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18565.67, "timestamp": "05:09:25", "text": "忙，忙。此外，他们还必须与……交谈"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18568.07, "timestamp": "05:09:28", "text": "我爸之类的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18571.11, "timestamp": "05:09:31", "text": "还有那件事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18573.99, "timestamp": "05:09:33", "text": "因为有些人打电话来了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18576.868, "timestamp": "05:09:36", "text": "因为有那条推文，所以才去了那家律师事务所。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18580.55, "timestamp": "05:09:40", "text": "现在，这家锁具公司并不存在，谷歌也不存在。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18582.23, "timestamp": "05:09:42", "text": "搜索一下之类的，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18585.19, "timestamp": "05:09:45", "text": "那条推文里冒充者的人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18587.51, "timestamp": "05:09:47", "text": "让人感觉那是一种直接威胁。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18590.39, "timestamp": "05:09:50", "text": "到实际的律师事务所。 [笑声] 所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18592.23, "timestamp": "05:09:52", "text": "有些人打电话"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18595.27, "timestamp": "05:09:55", "text": "律师事务所之类的。我知道那些人是谁"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18599.03, "timestamp": "05:09:59", "text": "确实如此，但是，是的，那些真正尝试过的人呢？"}]